# detail
Change count: 1

1. Modify | Implementation block

   Changed the construction and return of the URL string in `url_for` as a whole.

   The original implementation contained:

   * Assignment statement: directly using `self._formatter.format_map(parts)` to generate `url`;
   * Return statement: returning `URL(url)`.

   The new implementation contains:

   * Assignment statement: first calling `URL.build(path=v).raw_path` on each value in `parts`, then passing the generated mapping to `self._formatter.format_map(...)`;
   * Return statement: returning `URL.build(path=url)`.
